, exploring new environments, or competing with friends, every match is pure chaos and excitement. With community-driven updates, new game modes, and a focus on fun, this fangame offers a unique spin while keeping the spirit of Gorilla Tag alive.", "short_description": "A fast-paced Gorilla Tag fangame where you swing, climb, and chase your friends through unique maps and thrilling game modes. Pure movement-based fun\u2014no sticks, no buttons, just you and your hands."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/92ae50d7-e900-4055-a3e0-c8303bf443dd", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Solace", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rCvWSnXSLx7S6l5MGDtEUKyF64QrHnNTFy_AwWiJDoE/edit?usp=sharing", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "9749280568506507"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295853_1361043535437929_9162094596990059419_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=szw2w6phOTMQ7kNvwFjELMq&_nc_oc=Adp1vuKL8GBDWyDjYEUAi42HfCpYrdSts7t2ha-XyHZmLJyNRB3mih0CFBpEpFlUP0k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3HWykdkjx8ip_tbhX2iLhJWlq-w1XigdVEh5EayUYu5g&oe=69F0BEAB"}, "is_concep